   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: finding; f1040s1 line 9, \"Add lines 8a through 8z\". The value is right: each item not summed refuses the return elsewhere (8a scope.nol and 8l scope.rental through scope.schedule1 at Form 1040 line 8; 8d sa.excluded_income on Schedule A lines 6, 15, 16, read by sa.itemizes; 8n, 8o scope.cfc through scope.other_line16; 8p the excess business loss refusal on line 3; 8q person.x_edu_taxable through person.x_other on Form 5329; 8s scope.medicaid_waiver through scope.other_income), so 8a, 8d, 8l, 8n to 8q and 8s are not silently dropped, as the reply says. But the line's citation says those lines \"are refused by s1.line8_other\", which since the redraft tests only 8e, 8k, 8m and 8t to 8v: the line names the wrong screen. Low (BUG-0637).",
   "subject_key": "c8f250768e2169dbc51e004758e4bd5c10cc92226ab074fa0cb14bf2f41c314d"
  },
  {
