   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; f1040s1 line 25, \"Add lines 24a through 24z\". Lines 24b to 24z are refused by scope.schedule1 (\"Any income or adjustment requiring Schedule 1 other than the ones this tool asks about separately ...\"), which refuses Form 1040 line 8 and line 10 and every line after them (it lists jury duty pay given to the employer, line 24a, among the items asked separately); within scope they are zero, as the line's citation says. Line 24a is figured (decision D3). Same ruling as the earlier rounds; re-judged because line 24a now reads its gate line s1.jury_to_employer_if_pay. Project stands on the English.",
